## Out of scope until new spec

Stages 5–8: quarantine conversion, favourites/sequences, TypeDB storage replacement, main investigation UI.

## Execution rules

1. Bind work to SPEC-002 requirement IDs (R2-xx-xx) or explicit `SPEC_GAP` with follow-up issue
2. Pick up GitHub issues from epics; comment on issue at start, plan change, blocker, and completion (GOV-06)
3. Branch `feature/<issue>-<slug>` from integration branch; PR to `develop` when aligned, else document divergence
4. Stage 4: one GitHub issue per module; all routes for that module close within that single issue
5. Record completed issue closure in `.tasks/issue-<n>.json` and `.tasks/issue-<n>.md` when operator approves merge
